{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CI0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$$\n|\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Z}|\n$$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-universally-injective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:034bdcc7c461c8bae021bc53ec9f672696fd1948b47a7c22a57d80e661d85fe4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3669b1c11edfda1ada16aa5ed6b503cc4226bcf7f03f1e38d63e1bbfec4f4314", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>universally injective<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every morphism\nof algebraic stacks <MATH_0003> the map\n<MATH_0004>\nis injective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:124d875f37354f8adda3a72de8a7f5097db77080412ffc52f2e750cb521fc4ff", "unit_id": "tag:0CI2:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CI0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universally-injective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bafb713b8c87fe8bf119349062c103d21861aebe17009f574c6674db45cd2f99", "source_text": "The base change of a universally injective morphism of algebraic stacks\nby any morphism of algebraic stacks is universally injective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3bac8df01e542e9dc99e1788ae1b4307590cd13d1bf2c99b9f4b405f0719908d", "unit_id": "tag:0CI3:statement"}
